2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154327Z === Manual plan override ===
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154332Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154429Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154551Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154693Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154785Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154862Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7154936Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155021Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155116Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155204Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155293Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155391Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155396Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155481Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155567Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155669Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155753Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155860Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7155950Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156053Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156144Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156250Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156376Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156504Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156509Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156595Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156716Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156823Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156909Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7156999Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157008Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157104Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157265Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157367Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157458Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157554Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157654Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157811Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7157930Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158028Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158033Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158185Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158349Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158481Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158658Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158666Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7158847Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159033Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159191Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159391Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159552Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159677Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159684Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7159856Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160024Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160145Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160261Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160376Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160384Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160515Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160632Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160726Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7160816Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161058Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161215Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161310Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161420Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161570Z   ok   a non-finite or over-nameplate power reading is no measurement
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161694Z   ok   a power reading at the nameplate is a measurement
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161837Z   ok   a frequency past its configured maximum measures nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7161982Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162089Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162188Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162329Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162508Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162644Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162784Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7162943Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163069Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163216Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163415Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163563Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163693Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7163876Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164050Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164233Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164353Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164535Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164706Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7164852Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165020Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165201Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165383Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165539Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165714Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165719Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7165844Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166001Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166112Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166241Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166367Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166492Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166630Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166637Z 
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166769Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7166875Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-11-14T21:06:57.7167000Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
